  "final_answer": "I found the answer. I navigated to the Amazon product page for the PlayStation 4 Console - 1TB Slim Edition (Renewed), which is the best-selling PS4 listing on Amazon. The page clearly displays the protection plan options offered alongside the console:\n\n## Answer: The cost of a 2-year protection for PS4 on Amazon is **$21.99**\n\nThis 2-Year Protection Plan is offered directly on the PlayStation 4 Console - 1TB Slim Edition (Renewed) product page (priced at $195.00). The plan is provided as an add-on option that can be checked when adding the console to the cart.\n\nFor reference, there are other ASURION-branded standalone 2-year protection plans on Amazon for new gaming consoles in higher price tiers, such as:\n- 2-Year Gaming Protection Plan ($400 - $449.99 tier) — $42.99\n- 2-Year Electronics Protection Plan ($450 - $499.99 tier) — $47.99\n\nBut for the main PS4 listing shown on Amazon (Renewed 1TB Slim Edition), the 2-year protection costs **$21.99**.",
